  "description": "The KOYNA DISC 24\" is a versatile 24-inch commuter bike designed for urban riding, daily commuting, and weekend adventures. Built around a relaxed geometry, wide handlebars, and high-volume tires, it delivers exceptional comfort, stability, and confidence in city traffic and mixed-surface conditions.\n\nCrafted from a lightweight and durable Reynolds 525 double-butted chromoly steel frameset and paired with a CrMo steel biplanar fork, the KOYNA DISC combines the smooth ride quality of steel with modern functionality. Its 1x10 drivetrain provides a wide gear range for efficient city riding, while hydraulic disc brakes deliver dependable stopping power in all weather conditions.\n\nWith clearance for tires up to 24\" x 2.25\", the KOYNA DISC is ready for everything from smooth tarmac to rough urban roads, making it an ideal compact commuter, fitness bike, and everyday utility bicycle.\n\nHydraulic Disc Brakes (160mm Front / 160mm Rear)\n\nMetro 24\" x 1.75\" (507 x 44C) Tires\n\nTire Clearance up to 24\" x 2.25\"\n\nDesigned for Urban Commuting, Daily Transportation, and Weekend Rides",
